&command_line off
ps "New Year's Day is" [date January 1]
ps "Lincoln's Birthday is" [date February 12]
ps "Washington's Birthday (3rd Monday in February) is" [date January 31 next Monday +2 weeks]
ps "St. Patrick's Day is" [date March 17]
ps "Mother's Day (2nd Sunday in May) is" [date April 30 next Sunday +1 week]
ps "Memorial Day (4th Monday in May) is" [date April 30 next Monday +3 weeks]
ps "Father's Day (3rd Sunday in June) is" [date May 30 next Sunday +2weeks]
ps "Independence Day is" [date July 4]
ps "Labor Day (1st Monday in Sept) is" [date August 31 next Monday]
ps "Columbus Day (2nd Monday in October) is" [date September 30 next Monday +1 week]
ps "Veterans Day (4th Monday in October) is" [date September 30 next Monday +3 weeks]
ps "Thanksgiving (4th Thursday in November) is" [date October 31 next Thursday +3 weeks]
ps "Christmas is" [date December 25]
